<pacific-essences-quiz class="pacific-essences-quiz section-{{ section.id }}" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="paq__container page-width">

    <div class="paq__screen" id="PAQIntro-{{ section.id }}">
      <h2 class="paq__heading">Pacific Essences<sup>®</sup></h2>
      <p class="paq__subtitle">Energy Medicine® from Nature &mdash; Self Selection Questionnaire</p>
      <div class="paq__intro-body">
        <p>There are many ways to choose essences for ourselves. One of the ways is to ask yourself questions so that you can focus in more easily on what you are really willing and able to shift or change at this particular point in time.</p>
        <p>Check off all the statements which you spontaneously and immediately think or feel apply to you. When you are done, click <strong>Find My Essence</strong> to discover which essence is most useful to you right now.</p>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="paq__button button" id="PAQStartBtn-{{ section.id }}">Begin Questionnaire</button>
    </div>

    <div class="paq__screen paq__screen--hidden" id="PAQQuiz-{{ section.id }}">
      <h2 class="paq__heading">Check all that apply to you</h2>
      <p class="paq__quiz-note">Be spontaneous &mdash; go with your first instinct.</p>
      <div class="paq__questions-list" id="PAQQuestions-{{ section.id }}"></div>
      <div class="paq__submit-area">
        <button type="button" class="paq__button button" id="PAQSubmitBtn-{{ section.id }}">Find My Essence</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="paq__screen paq__screen--hidden" id="PAQResult-{{ section.id }}">
      <p class="paq__result-label">Your recommended essence</p>
      <div class="paq__result-inner" id="PAQResultInner-{{ section.id }}"></div>
      <button type="button" class="paq__button paq__button--ghost button" id="PAQRetryBtn-{{ section.id }}">Retake the Quiz</button>
    </div>

  </div>
</pacific-essences-quiz>

